  "description": "Socratic learning mode for Claude Code — 7 activatable insight types (Insight, Flow, Tradeoff, Pattern, Level Up, Concept, Curious), curiosity-driven\nquestioning before executing, and a persistent concept glossary that grows over time. Built for empirical developers.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **2 commands** and **1 hook**.\n\n- **Commands** (2): `init`, `socratic`\n- **Hooks** (1): `SessionStart`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install https-github-com-chrlss11-claude-socratic-plugin@claude-community` from `chrlss11/claude-socratic-plugin`.\n\nDesigned for empirical developers: no academia, no empty theory. Just useful context at the exact moment you need it.",
